  (4610, md5($bt$[{"phase":"education","start":null,"end":null,"title":"Chace Boys' Comprehensive School","organisation":"Chace Boys' Comprehensive School","detail":"He was educated at Chace Boys' Comprehensive School.","source":{"title":"Politics.co.uk: Bambos Charalambous","url":"https://www.politics.co.uk/people/bambos-charalambous/"}},{"phase":"education","start":null,"end":null,"title":"Tottenham College","organisation":"Tottenham College","detail":"He attended Tottenham College.","source":{"title":"Politics.co.uk: Bambos Charalambous","url":"https://www.politics.co.uk/people/bambos-charalambous/"}},{"phase":"education","start":null,"end":null,"title":"Law","organisation":"Liverpool Polytechnic","detail":"He studied law at Liverpool Polytechnic.","source":{"title":"Politics.co.uk: Bambos Charalambous","url":"https://www.politics.co.uk/people/bambos-charalambous/"}},{"phase":"education","start":"1990","end":"1990","title":"Vice President, Students' Union","organisation":"Liverpool Polytechnic Students' Union","detail":"He was elected vice president of the Students' Union in 1990.","source":{"title":"Politics.co.uk: Bambos Charalambous","url":"https://www.politics.co.uk/people/bambos-charalambous/"}},{"phase":"career","start":null,"end":null,"title":"Qualified as a solicitor","organisation":null,"detail":"He qualified and worked as a solicitor.","source":{"title":"Politics.co.uk: Bambos Charalambous","url":"https://www.politics.co.uk/people/bambos-charalambous/"}},{"phase":"career","start":null,"end":null,"title":"Solicitor, housing litigation team","organisation":"Hackney Council","detail":"He worked for Hackney Council on its housing litigation team for 16 years before entering Parliament.","source":{"title":"Bambos Charalambous MP: About Bambos","url":"https://www.bambos.org.uk/about-bambos/"}},{"phase":"politics","start":"1994","end":null,"title":"Councillor, Palmers Green ward","organisation":"Enfield Council","detail":"He has been a councillor in Palmers Gr